# RXWOD — Project Context

Full-stack CrossFit WOD creator: **Go API** (Echo, PostgreSQL, Viper) + **Vue 3 UI** (Composition API, Vite).

## Repository Layout

```text
frontend/   Vue 3 UI (feature-sliced)
backend/    Go API (Clean Architecture + DDD)
db/         PostgreSQL migrations (numbered *.up.sql / *.down.sql)
docs/       Architecture guides (e.g. EXTENDING_WOD_TYPES.md)
```

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Stack |
|-------|-------|
| Backend | Go 1.22+, Echo, pgx, Viper, JWT auth |
| Frontend | Vue 3.5, Vue Router 4, TypeScript (strict), Vite 6, Vitest |
| Database | PostgreSQL via Docker Compose |
| Auth | JWT access/refresh tokens + `X-Gym-ID` gym workspace header |

## Domain Concepts

- **WOD** — multi-stage program (WARMUP, STRENGTH, CORE, METCON, COOLDOWN)
- **Workout types** — AMRAP, FORTIME, TABATA, EMOM, OPEN
- **Gyms** — multi-tenant workspaces with owner/coach/athlete roles

## Quality Gates

```bash
make test                              # backend + frontend unit tests
cd backend && go test ./...
cd frontend && npm run typecheck && npm run test:unit && npm run build
```

## Scope Discipline

- Minimize diff scope; match existing patterns in the touched layer.
- Do not add tests, docs, or abstractions unless requested or clearly needed.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, JWT secrets, credentials).
